{"text":"at a certain age who is unmarried, we just think he hasn't come around to making his pick. It's easy for us to say, oh, but women can just say no to all of this. But the reality is more difficult and more complex. We're all social beings. We internalize ideas from our socialization. Even the language we use in talking about marriage and relationships illustrates this. The language of marriage is often the language of ownership rather than the language of partnership. We use the word respect to mean something a woman shows a man, but often not something a man shows a woman. Both men and women in Nigeria will say, this is an expression I'm very amused by, I did it for peace in my marriage.","words":[{"text":"at","start":0.0,"end":0.38},{"text":"a","start":0.38,"end":0.52},{"text":"certain","start":0.52,"end":0.68},{"text":"age","start":0.68,"end":0.9},{"text":"who","start":0.9,"end":1.06},{"text":"is","start":1.06,"end":1.12},{"text":"unmarried","start":1.12,"end":1.46,"punct":","},{"text":"we","start":2.06,"end":2.3},{"text":"just","start":2.3,"end":2.46},{"text":"think","start":2.46,"end":2.64},{"text":"he","start":2.64,"end":2.78},{"text":"hasn't","start":2.78,"end":2.96},{"text":"come","start":2.96,"end":3.14},{"text":"around","start":3.14,"end":3.4},{"text":"to","start":3.4,"end":3.58},{"text":"making","start":3.58,"end":3.7},{"text":"his","start":3.7,"end":3.98},{"text":"pick","start":3.98,"end":4.2,"punct":"."},{"text":"It's","start":6.48,"end":6.9},{"text":"easy","start":6.9,"end":7.1},{"text":"for","start":7.1,"end":7.36},{"text":"us","start":7.36,"end":7.5},{"text":"to","start":7.5,"end":7.78},{"text":"say","start":7.78,"end":8.1,"punct":","},{"text":"oh","start":8.4,"end":8.5,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":8.54,"end":8.66},{"text":"women","start":8.66,"end":8.82},{"text":"can","start":8.82,"end":9.02},{"text":"just","start":9.02,"end":9.22},{"text":"say","start":9.22,"end":9.4},{"text":"no","start":9.4,"end":9.54},{"text":"to","start":9.54,"end